      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a terrible burden to carry, and the only way to truly stop hurting them is to make your presence a source of light, not a shadow. You are not their burden; you are their child, and their love is unconditional, not a transaction based on your success. If you feel like you are failing them, then perhaps the only way to honor their sacrifice is to let go of the guilt and find your own path, even if it is difficult.",
