      "content": "but it's not just guilt, it's like looking at them and knowing i'm the reason they're struggling. if i wasn't around, they wouldn't have to worry about me anymore. they could just be proud of what they built without seeing it all fall apart through me. it feels like the only way to actually protect their dignity is to just not be a part of the picture anymore. doesn't that kind of make sense?",
